  "body": "**[Original report](https://bitbucket.org/agriggio/art/issues/87) by Former user (Bitbucket: [Former user](https://bitbucket.org/Former user), ).**\n\n----------------------------------------\n\nversion: 1.3-38-g7f578f388 built with GCC 9.3.0\n\nSomething happened to the Editor, especially the zooming, which leads to strange result.\n\nI want to edit a new raw image that was just copied to the system, so there's no arp file present. After opening the file in the editor, the auto matched tone curve is applied:\n\n![](https://bitbucket.org/repo/9pArXyE/images/413523665-before_zoom.png)\nAfter zooming to 1:1 it seems like the auto-matched curve is not applied anymore:\n\n![](https://bitbucket.org/repo/9pArXyE/images/907864758-after_zoom.png)\nSometimes this happens again after setting the profile back to “Default” and zooming in again.\n",
